context:
DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/magic/bgp/filter_profiles/{profile_id}
Deletes a BGP filter profile.
Required: account_id (path); profile_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/magic/bgp/filter_profiles/{profile_id}
Gets a specific BGP filter profile for an account.
Required: account_id (path); profile_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/magic/bgp/filter_profiles/{profile_id}
Updates a BGP filter profile. Omitted properties are left unchanged. To clear an existing description send `description: ""`.
Required: account_id (path); profile_id (path); body (body)
